{"run_id": "20260829T212149-free-sql-17601", "qid": "gabriel-gf-01", "repeat": 0, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "f92f1f0-dirty", "question": "Which analyses are searches (rather than measurements) whose event selection uses both b-tagged jets and missing transverse momentum?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The searches whose event selections use both **b-tagged jets** and **missing transverse momentum** are:\n\n- **arXiv:2006.05880** — *Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or \\(Z\\) boson using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\(pp\\) collision data at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector*\n- **arXiv:2107.12553** — *Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and \\(W\\) bosons using 137 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV*\n- **arXiv:2209.07327** — *Search for pair production of vector-like quarks in leptonic final states in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV*\n- **arXiv:2211.08028** — *Search for supersymmetry in final states with missing transverse momentum and three or more \\(b\\)-jets in 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of proton–proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector*", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2403.01556", "2405.18661", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "b-tagged jets used in event selection", "kind": "", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:bjet | detector_object | b-tagged jets\nhepkg:object:bjet_reco | detector_object | b-tagged jet\nhepkg:object:bjet-relaxed | detector_object | subleading b-tagged j"}, {"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "missing transverse momentum used in event selection", "kind": "", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:met | detector_object | Missing transverse momentum\nhepkg:object_selection:met_1L2L | selection_requirement | 1L/2L channel missing transverse momentum selection\n"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, p.arxiv_id, p.title, p.category, a.predicate, a.subject_id, es.label AS subject_label, a.object_id, eo.label AS object_label\nFROM assertion a\nJOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id\nJOIN entity es ON es.entity_id=a.subject_id\nJOIN entity eo ON eo.entity_id=a.object_id\nWHERE a.paper_id IN (\n  SELECT paper_id FROM assertion WHERE object_id IN ('hepkg:object:bjet','hepkg:object:bjet_reco','hepkg:object:bjet-relaxed','hepkg:object:bjet-tight','hepkg:object:btrackjet','hepkg:object:b-tagged-ak4-jet','hepkg:object:bjet_tight_detector')\n  AND predicate IN ('region_requires_object','object_has_selection','region_has_selection','result_defines_object','result_defines_region')\n)\nAND a.object_id IN ('hepkg:object:met','hepkg:object:missing_et','hepkg:object:met_reco','hepkg:object:etmiss','hepkg:object:track_met','hepkg:object:met_track','hepkg:object:neutrino')\nAND a.predicate IN ('region_requires_object','object_has_selection','region_has_selection','result_defines_object','result_defines_region')\nORDER BY a.paper_id LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 38, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | arxiv_id | title | category | predicate | subject_id | subject_label | object_id | object_label\n2004.14060 | 2004.14060 | Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic $t"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "WITH b AS (\n SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id\n WHERE (lower(e.label) LIKE '%b-tag%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%b jet%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%b-jet%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%b\\u00a0-jet%')\n   AND a.predicate IN ('region_requires_object','object_has_selection','region_has_selection','result_defines_object','result_defines_region')\n), m AS (\n SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id\n WHERE (lower(e.label) LIKE '%missing transverse%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%missing et%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%e_t%miss%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%p_t%miss%')\n   AND a.predicate IN ('region_requires_object','object_has_selection','region_has_selection','result_defines_object','result_defines_region')\n)\nSELECT p.arxiv_id, p.title, p.category FROM paper p JOIN b ON b.paper_id=p.arxiv_id JOIN m ON m.paper_id=p.arxiv_id WHERE p.category='search' ORDER BY p.arxiv_id"}, "rows": 22, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title | category\n2004.14060 | Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic $t\\bar{t}$ plus missing transverse momentum final state at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS de"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "WITH x AS (\n SELECT a.paper_id, a.subject_id,\n   MAX(CASE WHEN lower(e.label) LIKE '%b-tag%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%b jet%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%b-jet%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%b\\u00a0-jet%' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS has_b,\n   MAX(CASE WHEN lower(e.label) LIKE '%missing transverse%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%missing et%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%e_t%miss%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%p_t%miss%' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS has_met\n FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id\n WHERE a.predicate='region_requires_object'\n GROUP BY a.paper_id,a.subject_id\n)\nSELECT p.arxiv_id,p.title FROM x JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=x.paper_id WHERE p.category='search' AND has_b=1 AND has_met=1 ORDER BY p.arxiv_id"}, "rows": 31, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title\n2006.05880 | Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or $Z$ boson using 139 fb -1 of $pp$ collision data at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n2006.05880 | Search for top"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT p.arxiv_id, p.title, a.predicate, e.kind, e.entity_id, e.label\nFROM assertion a JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id\nWHERE p.arxiv_id IN ('2006.05880','2107.12553','2209.07327','2211.08028')\nAND a.predicate IN ('region_requires_object','object_has_selection','region_has_selection')\nAND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%b-tag%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%b jet%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%b-jet%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%missing transverse%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%missing et%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%e_t%miss%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%p_t%miss%')\nORDER BY p.arxiv_id, p.arxiv_id, e.label"}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title | predicate | kind | entity_id | label\n2006.05880 | Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or $Z$ boson using 139 fb -1 of $pp$ collision data at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATL"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:final-state:dilepton-0b", "hepkg:final-state:dilepton-2b", "hepkg:final_state:3l", "hepkg:final_state:dilepton-met", "hepkg:final_state:tth-dimuon-bjets", "hepkg:object:b-tagged-ak4-jet", "hepkg:object:b-tagged-jet", "hepkg:object:bjet", "hepkg:object:bjet-relaxed", "hepkg:object:bjet-tight", "hepkg:object:bjet_reco", "hepkg:object:bjet_tight_detector", "hepkg:object:btrackjet", "hepkg:object:etmiss", "hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate", "hepkg:object:met", "hepkg:object:met-particle", "hepkg:object:met_reco", "hepkg:object:met_track", "hepkg:object:missing-transverse-momentum", "hepkg:object:missing_et", "hepkg:object:neutrino", "hepkg:object:track_met", "hepkg:object_selection:bjet_count_baseline", "hepkg:object_selection:met_1L2L", "hepkg:observable:b_jet_tagging_efficiency", "hepkg:observable:c_jet_tagging_efficiency", "hepkg:region:3l-zdom-sr", "hepkg:region:baseline", "hepkg:region:elastic_candidate_selection", "hepkg:region:hmdy_cc_wlnu_fiducial", "hepkg:region:htautau_fiducial", "hepkg:region:hww_fiducial", "hepkg:region:sr-0b", "hepkg:region:sr-1b", "hepkg:region:sr-2b", "hepkg:region:sr-gbb-2000-1800", "hepkg:region:sr-gbb-2100-1600", "hepkg:region:sr-gbb-2300-1000", "hepkg:region:sr-gbb-2800-1400", "hepkg:region:sr-gbb-b", "hepkg:region:sr-gbb-c", "hepkg:region:sr-gbb-m", "hepkg:region:sr-gtb-b", "hepkg:region:sr-gtb-c", "hepkg:region:sr-gtb-m", "hepkg:region:sr-gtt-0l-b", "hepkg:region:sr-gtt-0l-c", "hepkg:region:sr-gtt-0l-m1", "hepkg:region:sr-gtt-0l-m2", "hepkg:region:sr-gtt-1800-1", "hepkg:region:sr-gtt-1900-1400", "hepkg:region:sr-gtt-1l-b", "hepkg:region:sr-gtt-1l-c", "hepkg:region:sr-gtt-1l-m1", "hepkg:region:sr-gtt-1l-m2", "hepkg:region:sr-gtt-2100-1", "hepkg:region:sr-gtt-2300-1200", "hepkg:region:w_lnu_selection", "hepkg:result:260119c5314b01ee54efcb2b", "hepkg:result:41a28dc1f1facf4afa0c34f5", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:52d0213216b446bc782fa4dc", "hepkg:result:61bead068d7011cdb8e37e4c", "hepkg:result:7200eaf50e8b0d75d67a30e7", "hepkg:result:989da7e0af809d38ad040be8", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:d0ff6542be328ba2a125a5cb", "hepkg:systematic:btag-b", "hepkg:systematic:btag-c", "hepkg:systematic:jets-and-met", "hepkg:systematic:met-mismeasurement", "hepkg:systematic:met-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:met_measurement", "hepkg:systematic:met_modelling", "hepkg:systematic:met_resolution", "hepkg:systematic:met_scale_resolution", "hepkg:systematic:met_selection_efficiency", "hepkg:systematic:ptmiss_uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:unclustered_met"], "evidence_ids": [], "seen_values": [], "verification_score": null, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 6, "prompt_tokens": 37364, "completion_tokens": 1790, "rounds": 6, "seconds": 22.89309597015381, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 22.89309597015381, "llm_calls": 6.0, "tokens": 39154.0, "rounds": 6.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "judged_precision": 0.75, "judged_recall": 0.375, "judged_f1": 0.5, "judged_named_none": 0.0, "judged_coverage": 0.55, "retrieval_reach": 0.875, "tool_calls": 6.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 80.0, "evidence_quotes": 0.0}}
{"run_id": "20260829T212149-free-sql-17601", "qid": "gabriel-gf-01-condition", "repeat": 0, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "f92f1f0-dirty", "question": "Which analyses use b-tagged jets (jets identified as containing a b-hadron) in their event selection?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The graph identifies **32 analyses** whose event-selection information includes b-tagged jets or b-jet requirements:\n\n- **2001.06899** — Measurement of associated \\(Z+\\) charm/bottom-jet production\n- **2004.04545** — \\(CP\\) properties of Higgs interactions in \\(t\\bar tH/tH,\\ H\\to\\gamma\\gamma\\)\n- **2004.14060** — Scalar-top search in all-hadronic \\(t\\bar t+\\) missing-momentum events\n- **2006.05880** — Top-squark search with a Higgs or \\(Z\\) boson\n- **2007.02873** — \\(WH/ZH\\) production with \\(H\\to b\\bar b\\)\n- **2009.04363** — Higgs decay to two muons\n- **2010.14293** — Squark and gluino search in jets plus missing momentum\n- **2012.03799** — New-phenomena search in one-lepton \\(t\\bar t\\) final states\n- **2012.08600** — SUSY search with opposite-charge same-flavor leptons and missing momentum\n- **2102.01444** — Search with two opposite-charge leptons, jets, and missing momentum\n- **2103.04956** — Higgs production in the four-lepton final state\n- **2103.06956** — Higgs production in the diphoton channel\n- **2106.01676** — Chargino–neutralino search in three-lepton final states\n- **2106.14246** — Electroweak chargino–neutralino production\n- **2107.12553** — Chargino–neutralino search with Higgs and \\(W\\) bosons\n- **2109.13808** — Higgs properties using \\(WW^*jj\\) production\n- **2110.11231** — Inclusive and differential \\(WZ\\) production\n- **2111.08340** — High-\\(p_T\\) Higgs production with \\(H\\to b\\bar b\\)\n- **2112.03161** — Heavy resonances decaying to boosted Higgs-boson pairs\n- **2201.11585** — Invisible Higgs decays produced via vector-boson fusion\n- **2202.08676** — Inclusive nonresonant multilepton search\n- **2205.05120** — Anomalous Higgs couplings\n- **2206.09466** — Higgs production in the \\(WW\\) decay channel\n- **2207.00348** — Higgs production in the \\(H\\to\\gamma\\gamma\\) channel\n- **2208.12095** — Charge asymmetry in \\(t\\bar t\\) production\n- **2209.07327** — Pair production of vector-like quarks in leptonic final states\n- **2211.08028** — SUSY search with three or more \\(b\\)-jets\n- **2302.05225** — Lepton-flavor-violating Higgs decays\n- **2303.15340** — Dilepton \\(t\\bar t\\) production\n- **2307.01094** — Squark/gluino search with same-sign or three leptons\n- **2308.02285** — \\(W+c\\) production\n- **2309.14442** — \\(t\\bar t b\\bar b\\) production in the lepton+jets channel\n- **2312.04450** — \\(t\\bar t Z\\) production, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2401.05299** — \\(t\\bar t W\\) production\n\nThis includes analyses where b-tagged jets enter signal, control, validation, or baseline selection regions—not papers that mention b-tagging only as a systematic uncertainty.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2405.18661", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "b-tagged jets, jets identified as containing a b-hadron, b jets used in event selection", "kind": "", "limit": 30}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:b_jet | detector_object | b-hadron-containing jet\nhepkg:object:bjet_reco | detector_object | b-tagged jet\nhepkg:object:bjet-relaxed | detector_object | b-tagged j"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT kind, entity_id, label FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%b%tag%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%b jet%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%b-hadron%' LIMIT 100"}, "rows": 100, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "kind | entity_id | label\ndetector_object | hepkg:object:b_jet | b-tagged jet\nevent_region | hepkg:region:ttbar_bjet_template_cr | High-purity ttbar control region for b jet M_SV template (lepton+>=2 j"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, p.title, p.arxiv_id, a.predicate, s.label AS subject_label, s.kind AS subject_kind, o.entity_id AS object_id, o.label AS object_label, o.kind AS object_kind FROM assertion a JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id LEFT JOIN entity s ON s.entity_id=a.subject_id LEFT JOIN entity o ON o.entity_id=a.object_id WHERE a.predicate IN ('object_has_selection','region_has_selection','region_requires_object','channel_has_region','result_defines_region','result_defines_object','result_has_channel') AND (lower(COALESCE(o.label,'')) LIKE '%b%tag%' OR lower(COALESCE(o.label,'')) LIKE '%b jet%' OR lower(COALESCE(o.label,'')) LIKE '%b-jet%' OR lower(COALESCE(o.label,'')) LIKE '%b-hadron%' OR lower(COALESCE(s.label,'')) LIKE '%b%tag%' OR lower(COALESCE(s.label,'')) LIKE '%b jet%' OR lower(COALESCE(s.label,'')) LIKE '%b-jet%' OR lower(COALESCE(s.label,'')) LIKE '%b-hadron%') ORDER BY a.paper_id, a.predicate LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 200, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | arxiv_id | predicate | subject_label | subject_kind | object_id | object_label | object_kind\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with c"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, p.title, a.predicate, COALESCE(s.label,'') AS subject_label, COALESCE(s.kind,'') AS subject_kind, COALESCE(o.label,'') AS object_label, COALESCE(o.kind,'') AS object_kind FROM assertion a JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id LEFT JOIN entity s ON s.entity_id=a.subject_id LEFT JOIN entity o ON o.entity_id=a.object_id WHERE (a.predicate='object_has_selection' AND lower(COALESCE(s.label,'')) LIKE '%b%tag%') OR (a.predicate IN ('region_requires_object','channel_has_region','region_has_selection') AND (lower(COALESCE(o.label,'')) LIKE '%b%tag%' OR lower(COALESCE(o.label,'')) LIKE '%b-jet%' OR lower(COALESCE(o.label,'')) LIKE '%b jet%' OR lower(COALESCE(s.label,'')) LIKE '%b%tag%' OR lower(COALESCE(s.label,'')) LIKE '%b-jet%' OR lower(COALESCE(s.label,'')) LIKE '%b jet%')) ORDER BY a.paper_id LIMIT 500"}, "rows": 200, "error": null, "truncated": true, "preview": "paper_id | title | predicate | subject_label | subject_kind | object_label | object_kind\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark je"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, p.title FROM assertion a JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id LEFT JOIN entity s ON s.entity_id=a.subject_id LEFT JOIN entity o ON o.entity_id=a.object_id WHERE (a.predicate='object_has_selection' AND (lower(COALESCE(s.label,'')) LIKE '%b%tag%' OR lower(COALESCE(s.label,'')) LIKE '%b jet%' OR lower(COALESCE(s.label,'')) LIKE '%b-jet%' OR lower(COALESCE(s.label,'')) LIKE '%b-hadron%')) OR (a.predicate='region_requires_object' AND (lower(COALESCE(o.label,'')) LIKE '%b%tag%' OR lower(COALESCE(o.label,'')) LIKE '%b jet%' OR lower(COALESCE(o.label,'')) LIKE '%b-jet%' OR lower(COALESCE(o.label,'')) LIKE '%b-hadron%')) OR (a.predicate='channel_has_region' AND (lower(COALESCE(o.label,'')) LIKE '%b%tag%' OR lower(COALESCE(o.label,'')) LIKE '%b jet%' OR lower(COALESCE(o.label,'')) LIKE '%b-jet%' OR lower(COALESCE(o.label,'')) LIKE '%b-hadron%')) ORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 48, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$   TeV\n2004.04545 | $CP$ "}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, p.title FROM assertion a JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id JOIN entity s ON s.entity_id=a.subject_id WHERE a.predicate='object_has_selection' AND (s.kind='detector_object' OR s.kind='selection_requirement') AND (lower(s.label) LIKE '%b%tag%' OR lower(s.label) LIKE '%b jet%' OR lower(s.label) LIKE '%b-jet%' OR lower(s.label) LIKE '%b-hadron%') ORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 45, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$   TeV\n2004.04545 | $CP$ "}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:lost_tw_background", "hepkg:background:mt_background", "hepkg:background:mw_background", "hepkg:background:nonprompt_jpsi", "hepkg:background:total-smooth-mJgamma", "hepkg:benchmark:bffN_btag", "hepkg:channel:diphoton_top_quarks", "hepkg:final-state:dilepton-0b", "hepkg:final-state:dilepton-1b", "hepkg:final-state:dilepton-2b", "hepkg:final_state:1lepton-4b-higgs-met", "hepkg:final_state:3lepton-Z-jets-met", "hepkg:final_state:alljets_met_0lepton", "hepkg:final_state:bb-large-R-jet", "hepkg:final_state:emu_os_1or2_bjets_reco", "hepkg:final_state:emu_ss_1or2_bjets_reco", "hepkg:final_state:ggh-dimuon-untagged", "hepkg:final_state:lepjets_ge5j_ge3b", "hepkg:final_state:met-4jets-3bjets-0or1lepton", "hepkg:final_state:tth-dimuon-bjets", "hepkg:finalstate:diphoton_tHq_leptonic", "hepkg:finalstate:diphoton_ttH_hadronic", "hepkg:generator:evtgen", "hepkg:method:ancillary_category_fit_bkg_co