{"run_id": "20260829T212149-free-sql-17601", "qid": "gabriel-gf-02", "repeat": 0, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "f92f1f0-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using an ABCD method, or an ABCD-style sideband or matrix method over independent regions?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The graph identifies **14 analyses** that estimate backgrounds with an ABCD, ABCD-style, sideband, or matrix method:\n\n- **2004.01678** — *Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a \\(Z\\) Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV \\(pp\\) Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector* — modified ABCD estimate.\n- **2006.05880** — *Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or \\(Z\\) boson using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\(pp\\) collision data at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector* — fake-factor/matrix method for fake/nonprompt leptons.\n- **2011.07812** — *Search for displaced leptons in \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV \\(pp\\) collisions with the ATLAS detector* — ABCD data-driven background estimate.\n- **2012.01581** — *Search for long-lived particles using displaced jets in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV* — ABCD-style ratio method using eight non-overlapping regions \\(A\\)–\\(H\\).\n- **2106.01676** — *Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum* — data-driven matrix method.\n- **2202.08676** — *Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV* — data-driven matrix method.\n- **2207.00348** — *Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV in the \\(H\\to\\gamma\\gamma\\) channel* — double two-dimensional sideband method.\n- **2208.12095** — *Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\(pp\\to t\\bar t\\) production at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector* — matrix method for the single-lepton fake-lepton estimate.\n- **2209.07327** — *Search for pair production of vector-like quarks in leptonic final states* — data-driven matrix method.\n- **2307.01094** — *Search for pair production of squarks or gluinos decaying via sleptons or weak bosons in final states with two same-sign or three leptons* — data-driven matrix method.\n- **2401.05299** — *Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\(t\\bar tW\\) production* — charge-misassignment rate from a \\(Z\\to e^+e^-\\) sideband method.\n- **2404.06204** — *Precise measurements of \\(W\\)- and \\(Z\\)-boson transverse-momentum spectra* — two-dimensional ABCD sideband method using control regions \\(B,C,D\\).\n- **2511.11853** — *Search for a new neutral gauge boson produced in association with one or two \\(b\\) jets and decaying into a pair of muons* — ABCD/matrix data-driven estimate using control regions.\n- **2604.27044** — *Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the \\(4b\\) final state* — multidimensional ABCD reweighting from control regions to the signal region.\n\nI excluded analyses whose entries only mention a generic mass-sideband fit or sideband validation without identifying an ABCD-like, matrix, or independent-region background-estimation procedure.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2006.05880", "2008.05928", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2307.01094", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "ABCD method background estimate using four independent control/signal regions", "kind": "background_method", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs | background_method | ABCD (matrix) data-driven background estimation using control regions in data with parametric fits\nhepkg:met"}, {"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "sideband method or matrix method for estimating backgrounds using independent regions", "kind": "background_method", "limit": 30}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs | background_method | ABCD (matrix) data-driven background estimation using control regions in data with parametric fits\nhepkg:met"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT e.entity_id, e.kind, e.label FROM entity e WHERE lower(e.label) LIKE '%abcd%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%matrix method%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%sideband%' LIMIT 100"}, "rows": 35, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:region:abcd-region-a | event_region | Modified ABCD estimate: Region A\nhepkg:region:abcd-region-b | event_region | Modified ABCD estimate: Region B\nhepkg:region:abcd-reg"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, p.title, p.arxiv_id, e.entity_id, e.label, a.predicate, a.object_value FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id = a.paper_id WHERE a.predicate='background_uses_method' AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%abcd%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%matrix method%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%sideband%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%independent region%') ORDER BY a.paper_id, e.label LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 18, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | arxiv_id | entity_id | label | predicate | object_value\n2004.01678 | Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Col"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT e.entity_id, e.label, COUNT(DISTINCT a.paper_id) AS n, group_concat(DISTINCT a.paper_id) AS papers FROM entity e JOIN assertion a ON a.object_id=e.entity_id AND a.predicate='background_uses_method' WHERE e.kind='background_method' AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%abcd%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%matrix%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%sideband%') GROUP BY e.entity_id,e.label ORDER BY e.label"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | label | n | papers\nhepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs | ABCD (matrix) data-driven background estimation using control regions in data with parametric fits | 1 | 2511.11853\nhepkg:"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, a.object_id, e.label, a.predicate FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id WHERE a.predicate IN ('background_uses_method','background_estimates','result_estimates_background') AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%abcd%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%matrix%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%2d sideband%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%sideband method%') ORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | object_id | label | predicate\n2004.01678 | hepkg:method:modified-abcd-estimate | Modified ABCD estimate | background_uses_method\n2006.05880 | hepkg:method:data-driven-fnp | Data-driven fake"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT p.arxiv_id, p.title FROM paper p WHERE p.arxiv_id IN ('2004.01678','2006.05880','2011.07812','2012.01581','2106.01676','2202.08676','2207.00348','2208.12095','2209.07327','2307.01094','2401.05299','2404.06204','2511.11853','2604.27044') ORDER BY p.arxiv_id"}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title\n2004.01678 | Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector\n2006.05880 | Search fo"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs", "hepkg:background_method:cr_normalisation_fit", "hepkg:background_method:data_driven_nonprompt_control_sample", "hepkg:background_method:mc-simulation-estimate", "hepkg:background_method:z-multijet-abcd-sideband", "hepkg:method:abcd-method", "hepkg:method:abcd-reweightin