{"run_id": "20260829T212149-free-sql-17601", "qid": "gabriel-gf-03", "repeat": 0, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "f92f1f0-dirty", "question": "Which analyses use the HistFitter framework for their statistical analysis?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The graph identifies **four analyses** that use the HistFitter framework:\n\n- **arXiv:2006.05880** — *Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or \\(Z\\) boson using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\(pp\\) collision data at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector*\n- **arXiv:2011.07812** — *Search for displaced leptons in \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV \\(pp\\) collisions with the ATLAS detector*\n- **arXiv:2106.01676** — *Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV \\(pp\\) collisions with the ATLAS detector*\n- **arXiv:2211.08028** — *Search for supersymmetry in final states with missing transverse momentum and three or more \\(b\\)-jets in 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of proton–proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector*\n\nThe corresponding statistical-method entities include **`hepkg:method:histfitter`** and **`hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit-histfitter`**.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2006.05880", "2011.07812", "2106.01676", "2211.08028", "2401.05299"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "HistFitter statistical analysis framework", "kind": "statistical_method", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:method:histfitter | statistical_method | HistFitter statistical framework\nhepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit-histfitter | statistical_method | HistFitter fit\nhepkg:meth"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, p.arxiv_id, p.title\nFROM assertion a\nJOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nJOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id = a.paper_id\nWHERE a.predicate = 'result_uses_statistical_method'\n  AND e.entity_id IN ('hepkg:method:histfitter','hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit-histfitter','hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit')\nORDER BY p.arxiv_id"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | arxiv_id | title\n2006.05880 | 2006.05880 | Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or $Z$ boson using 139 fb -1 of $pp$ collision data at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n201"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, p.arxiv_id, e.entity_id, e.label, a.predicate, a.subject_id\nFROM assertion a\nJOIN entity e ON e.entity_id IN (a.object_id, a.subject_id)\nJOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id = a.paper_id\nWHERE lower(e.label) LIKE '%histfitter%'\nORDER BY a.paper_id, a.predicate\nLIMIT 200"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | arxiv_id | entity_id | label | predicate | subject_id\n2006.05880 | 2006.05880 | hepkg:method:histfitter | HistFitter package with Gaussian nuisance parameters for systematic uncertainties |"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, p.title, a.object_id, e.label, a.notes, a.support\nFROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id\nWHERE a.predicate='result_uses_statistical_method'\n  AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%histfitter%' OR a.object_id IN ('hepkg:method:histfitter','hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit-histfitter','hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit'))\nORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | object_id | label | notes | support\n2006.05880 | Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or $Z$ boson using 139 fb -1 of $pp$ collision data at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLA"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:method:bayesian-eftfitter-batjl", "hepkg:method:binned-ml-fit", "hepkg:method:bootstrap_compatibility", "hepkg:method:bootstrap_correlation_test", "hepkg:method:cls-profile-likelihood-asymptotic", "hepkg:method:combine-tool", "hepkg:method:histfitter", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit-histfitter", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-ratio", "hepkg:method:pyhf-combination", "hepkg:method:simplified-likelihood-reinterpretation", "hepkg:method:statistical_covariance_matrix", "hepkg:method:statistical_only_fit_crosscheck", "hepkg:method:systematic_smoothing_pruning", "hepkg:result:145b646dbebeacbefd96614b", "hepkg:result:36007f1a5d23adf160cf4b1d", "hepkg:result:d0ff6542be328ba2a125a5cb", "hepkg:result:d5288b5bc0407b0b2005d131", "hepkg:statistical_method:combine_roofit_roostats_tool", "hepkg:statistical_method:profile-likelihood-test-statistic", "hepkg:statmethod:combine_roofit_roostats", "hepkg:statmethod:multi-bin-fit", "hepkg:statmethod:simultaneous-extended-ml-fit"], "evidence_ids": [], "seen_values": [], "verification_score": null, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 5, "prompt_tokens": 16519, "completion_tokens": 935, "rounds": 5, "seconds": 15.197202920913696, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 15.197202920913696, "llm_calls": 5.0, "tokens": 17454.0, "rounds": 5.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "judged_precision": 1.0, "judged_recall": 0.8, "judged_f1": 0.888888888888889, "judged_named_none": 0.0, "judged_coverage": 0.15, "retrieval_reach": 0.8, "tool_calls": 4.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 24.0, "evidence_quotes": 0.0}}
{"run_id": "20260829T212149-free-sql-17601", "qid": "gabriel-gf-04", "repeat": 0, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "f92f1f0-dirty", "question": "Which analyses unfold their measured distributions -- that is, correct them back to particle level or truth level?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The graph identifies **11 analyses that explicitly unfold measured distributions to particle-, parton-, or generator-level quantities**:\n\n- **arXiv:2001.06899** — *Measurement of the associated production of a Z boson with charm or bottom quark jets…*  \n  Uses TUnfold for differential distributions.\n\n- **arXiv:2110.11231** — *Measurement of the inclusive and differential WZ production cross sections…*  \n  Defines unfolded quantities as generator-level quantities and uses TUnfold.\n\n- **arXiv:2207.12246** — *Measurement of the total cross section and ρ-parameter from elastic scattering…*  \n  Uses iterative unfolding, with an SVD cross-check.\n\n- **arXiv:2208.12095** — *Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\(t\\bar t\\) production…*  \n  Uses fully Bayesian unfolding.\n\n- **arXiv:2308.02285** — *Measurement of the production cross section for a W boson in association with a charm quark…*  \n  Explicitly unfolds measurements to particle and parton levels.\n\n- **arXiv:2309.14442** — *Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\(t\\bar t b\\bar b\\) production in the lepton+jets channel…*  \n  Uses a binned maximum-likelihood fit for unfolding.\n\n- **arXiv:2312.04450** — *Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\(t\\bar t Z\\) production…*  \n  Uses profile-likelihood unfolding for particle-level differential cross sections.\n\n- **arXiv:2401.05299** — *Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\(t\\bar t W\\) production…*  \n  Uses profile-likelihood unfolding for particle-level differential cross sections.\n\n- **arXiv:2402.08486** — *Differential cross section measurements for \\(t\\bar t\\) production and additional jets…*  \n  Uses TUnfold with Tikhonov regularization.\n\n- **arXiv:2404.06204** — *Precise measurements of W- and Z-boson transverse momentum spectra…*  \n  Uses iterative Bayesian unfolding.\n\n- **arXiv:2408.03744** — *Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for W and Z boson production…*  \n  Uses a binned maximum-likelihood unfolding procedure.\n\nThere is also **arXiv:2506.13565**, which the graph associates with a **TUnfold bin-by-bin migration correction** for a lepton-flavor-ratio measurement. I would classify that as a related detector-migration correction rather than an explicitly documented particle-/truth-level unfolding analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2103.04956", "2110.11231", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2303.15340", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2506.13565"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "unfolded distribution corrected to particle level or truth level", "kind": "", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:observable:sigma-wc-particle-inclusive | observable | sigma(W+c) particle level\nhepkg:method:chi2-compatibility-test | statistical_method | $\\chi^{2}$ compatibility test"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT kind, entity_id, label FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%unfold%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%particle level%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%truth level%' LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 51, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "kind | entity_id | label\nsystematic_uncertainty | hepkg:systematic:pdf_scale_variation | PDF and mu_R, mu_F scale uncertainty (unfolding correction)\nstatistical_method | hepkg:method:binned_maximum_li"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, p.title, p.arxiv_id, e.entity_id, e.label, a.predicate FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id WHERE (a.predicate='result_uses_statistical_method' OR a.predicate='result_reports_quantity' OR a.predicate='result_measures_observable') AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%unfold%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%particle level%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%truth level%') ORDER BY a.paper_id LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 25, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | arxiv_id | entity_id | label | predicate\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collision"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT eo.paper_id, p.title, p.arxiv_id, eo.kind, eo.entity_id, eo.label FROM entity_occurrence eo JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=eo.paper_id WHERE lower(eo.label) LIKE '%unfold%' OR lower(eo.label) LIKE '%truth level%' OR lower(eo.label) LIKE '%particle level%' ORDER BY eo.paper_id LIMIT 300"}, "rows": 56, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | arxiv_id | kind | entity_id | label\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at "}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT p.arxiv_id, p.title, group_concat(DISTINCT e.label) AS unfolding_entities FROM paper p JOIN assertion a ON a.paper_id=p.arxiv_id JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id WHERE lower(e.label) LIKE '%unfold%' GROUP BY p.arxiv_id, p.title ORDER BY p.arxiv_id LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title | unfolding_entities\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$   T"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.predicate, e.label AS object_label, a.object_value, ev.quote FROM assertion a LEFT JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id LEFT JOIN assertion_evidence ae ON ae.assertion_id=a.assertion_id LEFT JOIN evidence ev ON ev.evidence_id=ae.evidence_id WHERE a.paper_id IN ('2001.06899','2110.11231','2207.12246','2208.12095','2308.02285','2309.14442','2312.04450','2401.05299','2402.08486','2404.06204','2408.03744','2506.13565') AND (lower(COALESCE(e.label,'')) LIKE '%unfold%' OR lower(COALESCE(e.label,'')) LIKE '%particle level%' OR lower(COALESCE(e.label,'')) LIKE '%truth level%') ORDER BY a.paper_id, a.predicate LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 71, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | predicate | object_label | object_value | quote\n2001.06899 | result_has_systematic | PDF and mu_R, mu_F scale uncertainty (unfolding correction) |  | The unfolding is performed with differe"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT p.arxiv_id, p.title, ev.quote FROM paper p JOIN assertion a ON a.paper_id=p.arxiv_id JOIN assertion_evidence ae ON ae.assertion_id=a.assertion_id JOIN evidence ev ON ev.evidence_id=ae.evidence_id WHERE p.arxiv_id IN ('2001.06899','2110.11231','2207.12246','2208.12095','2308.02285','2309.14442','2312.04450','2401.05299','2402.08486','2404.06204','2408.03744','2506.13565') AND (lower(ev.quote) LIKE '%unfold%' OR lower(ev.quote) LIKE '%particle level%' OR lower(ev.quote) LIKE '%truth level%') GROUP BY p.arxiv_id, ev.quote ORDER BY p.arxiv_id LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 62, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title | quote\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$   TeV | At the M"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:final_state:emu_fiducial_particle_level", "hepkg:method:asimov-closure-test", "hepkg:method:binned_maximum_likelihood_fit", "hepkg:method:chi2-compatibility-test", "hepkg:method:data_driven_closure_test", "hepkg:method:double_crystal_ball_fit", "hepkg:method:fully_bayesian_unfolding", "hepkg:method:iterative_unfolding", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-unfolding", "hepkg:method:statistical_covariance_matrix", "hepkg:method:svd_unfolding_crosscheck", "hepkg:method:tikhonov-regularisation", "hepkg:method:ttbar-ht-cr-correction", "hepkg:method:tunfold-least-squares-unfolding", "hepkg:method:tunfold-unfolding", "hepkg:method:tunfold_least_squares_unfolding", "hepkg:method:unfolding-particle-parton", "hepkg:object:additional_bjet_particle", "hepkg:object:bjet_particle", "hepkg:object:electron_particle", "hepkg:object:electron_veto_particle", "hepkg:object:higgs-boson-particle-level", "hepkg:object:jet_particle", "hepkg:object:lepton_particle", "hepkg:object:lightjet_particle", "hepkg:object:muon_particle", "hepkg:object:muon_veto_particle", "hepkg:object:pseudo-top-particle-4l", "hepkg:observable:dsigma-deta-particle", "hepkg:observable:dsigma-dpt-particle", "hepkg:observable:sigma-wc-particle-inclusive", "hepkg:region:emu_fiducial_particle", "hepkg:region:fiducial-3l-particle", "hepkg:region:fiducial-4l-particle", "hepkg:region:fiducial-particle", "hepkg:region:fiducial_phase_space", "hepkg:region:stxs-analysis-regions-45", "hepkg:region:w_fiducial", "hepkg:region:w_minus_signal_region", "hepkg:region:z_signal_region", "hepkg:result:ttbar_differential_xsec_generic", "hepkg:result:wminus-pt-13tev", "hepkg:result:wminus-pt-5p02tev", "hepkg:result:wplus-pt-13tev", "hepkg:result:wplus-pt-5p02tev", "hepkg:result:wz-differential-xsec", "hepkg:result:z-pt-ll-13tev", "hepkg:result:z-pt-ll-5p02tev", "hepkg:result:z-pt-ut-13tev", "hepkg:result:z-pt-ut-5p02tev", "hepkg:sample:ttbar_signal", "hepkg:statmethod:iterative-bayesian-unfolding", "hepkg:statmethod:pseudodata_closure_test", "hepkg:statmethod:tunfold_regularized_unfolding", "hepkg:systematic:background-related-uncertainty-differential", "hepkg:systematic:pdf_scale_variation", "hepkg:systematic:signal-generator-modelling", "hepkg:systematic:unfolding-prior-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:unfolding-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:unfolding_bias", "hepkg:systematic:unfolding_closure"], "evidence_ids": [], "seen_values": [], "verification_score": null, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 6, "prompt_tokens": 48098, "completion_tokens": 2087, "rounds": 6, "seconds": 26.14810276031494, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 26.14810276031494, "llm_calls": 6.0, "tokens": 50185.0, "rounds": 6.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "judged_precision": 1.0, "judged_recall": 0.9090909090909091, "judged_f1": 0.9523809523809523, "judged_named_none": 0.0, "judged_coverage": 0.2833333333333333, "retrieval_reach": 1.0, "tool_calls": 7.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 61.0, "evidence_quotes": 0.0}}
{"run_id": "20260829T212149-free-sql-17601", "qid": "gabriel-gf-05", "repeat": 0, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "f92f1f0-dirty", "question": "Which analyses reconstruct a Higgs-boson candidate as a physical object they select on (rather than merely studying Higgs production or decay)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph identifies these analyses as selecting a reconstructed Higgs candidate or Higgs-containing object:\n\n- **arXiv:2006.05880** — *Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or \\(Z\\) boson…* (ATLAS)  \n  Reconstructs an \\(H\\to b\\bar b\\) candidate from a jet pair, requiring an optimized neural-network tag and at least one such candidate in the \\(H\\)-signal regions.\n\n- **arXiv:2103.04956** — *Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state…* (CMS)  \n  Builds a four-lepton \\(ZZ\\) candidate as the Higgs candidate and applies explicit lepton, dilepton-mass, and \\(m_{4\\ell}\\) selections, including \\(105<m_{4\\ell}<140\\) GeV for the fit.\n\n- **arXiv:2111.08340** — *Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\(H\\to b\\bar b\\) decays…* (ATLAS)  \n  Reconstructs the Higgs decay as an \\(H\\)-candidate large-radius jet containing the \\(b\\bar b\\) decay products. Candidate jets are selected with requirements such as \\(p_T>250\\) GeV, \\(|\\eta|<2\\), \\(m_J>60\\) GeV, and track-jet/b-tagging criteria.\n\n- **arXiv:2605.14245** — *Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions…* (CMS)  \n  Builds a Higgs candidate from a pair of reconstructed photons and selects the diphoton system in the \\(100<m_{\\gamma\\gamma}<180\\) GeV preselection/fit range.\n\nA borderline additional entry is **arXiv:2504.13081**, whose graph records a reconstructed Higgs-boson object and a cut on its transverse mass (\\(m_T^H>60\\) GeV). However, it is a combination of differential cross-section measurements rather than a standalone candidate-reconstruction analysis, so I would not count it under the stricter interpretation of the question.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2006.05880", "2103.04956", "2111.08340", "2504.13081", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "Higgs boson candidate reconstructed as a physical selected object in an analysis", "kind": "", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:higgs_boson | detector_object | Higgs boson (reconstructed candidate)\nhepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate | detector_object | Higgs boson candidate\nhepkg:object:di"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT kind, COUNT(*) AS n, GROUP_CONCAT(label, ' | ') AS labels FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%higgs%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h%' AND lower(label) LIKE '%candidate%' GROUP BY kind ORDER BY n DESC LIMIT 100"}, "rows": 16, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "kind | n | labels\nphysics_process | 45 | Higgs boson production in association with a vector boson (VH) | Gluon fusion Higgs boson production (ggH) | Vector boson fusion (VBF) Higgs production | Assoc"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT e.entity_id, e.kind, e.label, COUNT(DISTINCT eo.paper_id) AS papers FROM entity e JOIN entity_occurrence eo ON eo.entity_id=e.entity_id WHERE (lower(e.label) LIKE '%higgs%candidate%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%h boson candidate%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%h-jet%') GROUP BY e.entity_id,e.kind,e.label ORDER BY papers DESC"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label | papers\nhepkg:final_state:1lepton-4b-higgs-met | channel | Exactly one lepton plus ≥4 b-tagged jets including a Higgs boson candidate (h→bb̄) and missing transverse momentum "}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.subject_id, es.label AS subject_label, a.predicate, a.object_id, eo.label AS object_label, COUNT(*) AS n FROM assertion a JOIN entity es ON es.entity_id=a.subject_id LEFT JOIN entity eo ON eo.entity_id=a.object_id WHERE (lower(es.label) LIKE '%higgs%candidate%' OR lower(es.label) LIKE '%h boson candidate%' OR lower(es.label) LIKE '%h-jet%' OR lower(eo.label) LIKE '%higgs%candidate%' OR lower(eo.label) LIKE '%h boson candidate%' OR lower(eo.label) LIKE '%h-jet%') AND a.predicate IN ('object_has_selection','region_requires_object','result_defines_object','result_defines_region','region_has_selection') GROUP BY a.paper_id,a.subject_id,es.label,a.predicate,a.object_id,eo.label ORDER BY a.paper_id LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | subject_id | subject_label | predicate | object_id | object_label | n\n2006.05880 | hepkg:object:SR-h-1A | Signal region SR^h_1A (1ℓ selection, small χ̃2⁰-χ̃1⁰ mass splitting) | region_requi"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT p.arxiv_id,p.title,p.category,p.experiments FROM paper p WHERE p.arxiv_id IN ('2006.05880','2103.04956','2111.08340','2504.13081','2605.14245') ORDER BY p.arxiv_id"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title | category | experiments\n2006.05880 | Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or $Z$ boson using 139 fb -1 of $pp$ collision data at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector | "}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id,a.predicate,a.family,a.subject_id,es.label AS subject_label,a.object_id,eo.label AS object_label,a.object_value,a.support FROM assertion a LEFT JOIN entity es ON es.entity_id=a.subject_id LEFT JOIN entity eo ON eo.entity_id=a.object_id WHERE a.paper_id IN ('2006.05880','2103.04956','2111.08340','2504.13081','2605.14245') AND (a.subject_id IN ('hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate','hepkg:object:zz_candidate','hepkg:object:H-jet','hepkg:object:higgs_boson','hepkg:object:diphoton') OR a.object_id IN ('hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate','hepkg:object:zz_candidate','hepkg:object:H-jet','hepkg:object:higgs_boson','hepkg:object:diphoton')) ORDER BY a.paper_id,a.predicate"}, "rows": 23, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | predicate | family | subject_id | subject_label | object_id | object_label | object_value | support\n2006.05880 | object_has_selection | objects | hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate | Higgs "}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id,e.quote,a.predicate,es.label AS subject_label,eo.label AS object_label FROM assertion a JOIN assertion_evidence ae ON ae.assertion_id=a.assertion_id JOIN evidence e ON e.evidence_id=ae.evidence_id LEFT JOIN entity es ON es.entity_id=a.subject_id LEFT JOIN entity eo ON eo.entity_id=a.object_id WHERE a.paper_id IN ('2006.05880','2103.04956','2111.08340','2504.13081','2605.14245') AND (a.subject_id IN ('hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate','hepkg:object:zz_candidate','hepkg:object:H-jet','hepkg:object:higgs_boson','hepkg:object:diphoton') OR a.object_id IN ('hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate','hepkg:object:zz_candidate','hepkg:object:H-jet','hepkg:object:higgs_boson','hepkg:object:diphoton')) LIMIT 100"}, "rows": 22, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | quote | predicate | subject_label | object_label\n2605.14245 | $m>100\\,\\text{Ge\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$ | object_has_selection | Diphoton system (Higgs boson candidate) | \n2605.14245 | Once the p"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id,a.predicate,es.label AS subject_label,eo.label AS object_label,a.object_value,a.support FROM assertion a LEFT JOIN entity es ON es.entity_id=a.subject_id LEFT JOIN entity eo ON eo.entity_id=a.object_id WHERE a.paper_id='2111.08340' AND (lower(COALESCE(es.label,'')) LIKE '%jet%' OR lower(COALESCE(eo.label,'')) LIKE '%jet%' OR lower(COALESCE(a.object_value,'')) LIKE '%h-jet%' OR lower(COALESCE(a.object_value,'')) LIKE '%higgs%') ORDER BY a.predicate,subject_label LIMIT 100"}, "rows": 97, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | predicate | subject_label | object_label | object_value | support\n2111.08340 | background_uses_method | Multijet background | Analytic exponentiated-polynomial function fit to jet mass spec"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:ggf_production", "hepkg:background:vbf_production", "hepkg:final_state:1lepton-4b-higgs-met", "hepkg:model:higgs_portal_fermion_dm", "hepkg:model:higgs_portal_scalar_dm", "hepkg:model:higgs_portal_vector_dm", "hepkg:object:H-jet", "hepkg:object:SR-h-1A", "hepkg:object:SR-h-1AB", "hepkg:object:SR-h-1B", "hepkg:object:diphoton", "hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate", "hepkg:object:higgs-boson-particle-level", "hepkg:object:higgs_boson", "hepkg:object:large_radius_jet", "hepkg:object:lepton", "hepkg:object:w-boson", "hepkg:object:w_boson_candidate", "hepkg:object:z-boson", "hepkg:object:zz_candidate", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_y_h", "hepkg:observable:mbb-spectrum", "hepkg:observable:mu-h-inclusive", "hepkg:region:diphoton_preselection", "hepkg:region:w_minus_signal_region", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243dc6282c1e450", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:coupling_resolved", "hepkg:result:f5b1d9536f2db25c7969a697", "hepkg:sample:vbf-h", "hepkg:sample:vbf_background_ggf_analysis", "hepkg:statmethod:likelihood-ratio-test-statistic"], "evidence_ids": [], "seen_values": [], "verification_score": null, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 5, "prompt_tokens": 36065, "completion_tokens": 2355, "rounds": 5, "seconds": 26.403484344482422, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 26.403484344482422, "llm_calls": 5.0, "tokens": 38420.0, "rounds": 5.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disa