{"run_id": "20260829T212149-free-sql-17601", "qid": "gabriel-gf-03", "repeat": 1, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "f92f1f0-dirty", "question": "Which analyses use the HistFitter framework for their statistical analysis?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The graph identifies **three analyses** using the HistFitter framework for their statistical analysis:\n\n- **arXiv:2006.05880** — *Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or \\(Z\\) boson using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\(pp\\) collision data at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector*  \n  - Method entity: `hepkg:method:histfitter`\n\n- **arXiv:2011.07812** — *Search for displaced leptons in \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV \\(pp\\) collisions with the ATLAS detector*  \n  - Method entity: `hepkg:method:histfitter`\n\n- **arXiv:2211.08028** — *Search for supersymmetry in final states with missing transverse momentum and three or more \\(b\\)-jets in 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of proton–proton collisions with the ATLAS detector*  \n  - Method entity: `hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit-histfitter` (“Profile likelihood background-only fit implemented in HistFitter”)", "answered": true, "papers": ["2006.05880", "2011.07812", "2106.01676", "2211.08028", "2401.05299"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "HistFitter statistical analysis framework", "kind": "", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:method:histfitter | statistical_method | HistFitter statistical framework\nhepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit-histfitter | statistical_method | HistFitter fit\nhepkg:meth"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT p.arxiv_id, p.title, a.paper_id, a.predicate, e.entity_id, e.label, a.status FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id = a.paper_id WHERE a.object_id IN ('hepkg:method:histfitter','hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit-histfitter','hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit') AND a.predicate IN ('result_uses_statistical_method','result_uses_statistical_method') ORDER BY p.arxiv_id"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title | paper_id | predicate | entity_id | label | status\n2006.05880 | Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or $Z$ boson using 139 fb -1 of $pp$ collision data at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT p.arxiv_id, p.title, a.predicate, e.entity_id, e.label FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id = a.paper_id WHERE a.object_id IN ('hepkg:method:histfitter','hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit-histfitter','hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit') ORDER BY p.arxiv_id, a.predicate, e.entity_id"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title | predicate | entity_id | label\n2006.05880 | Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or $Z$ boson using 139 fb -1 of $pp$ collision data at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS dete"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:simulated_template_backgrounds", "hepkg:method:bayesian-eftfitter-batjl", "hepkg:method:bootstrap_compatibility", "hepkg:method:bootstrap_correlation_test", "hepkg:method:combine-tool", "hepkg:method:hcr-classifier-reweighting", "hepkg:method:histfitter", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit-histfitter", "hepkg:method:pyhf-combination", "hepkg:method:simplified-likelihood-reinterpretation", "hepkg:method:statistical_covariance_matrix", "hepkg:model:coupling_modifier_framework", "hepkg:model:kappa_framework", "hepkg:region:AR", "hepkg:region:hmumu_categories", "hepkg:statistical_method:combine_roofit_roostats_tool", "hepkg:statmethod:combine_roofit_roostats", "hepkg:statmethod:multi-bin-fit", "hepkg:systematic:statistical-mc"], "evidence_ids": [], "seen_values": [], "verification_score": null, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 4, "prompt_tokens": 12794, "completion_tokens": 648, "rounds": 4, "seconds": 10.120531797409058, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 10.120531797409058, "llm_calls": 4.0, "tokens": 13442.0, "rounds": 4.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "judged_precision": 1.0, "judged_recall": 0.6, "judged_f1": 0.7499999999999999, "judged_named_none": 0.0, "judged_coverage": 0.15, "retrieval_reach": 0.8, "tool_calls": 3.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 20.0, "evidence_quotes": 0.0}}
{"run_id": "20260829T212149-free-sql-17601", "qid": "gabriel-gf-04", "repeat": 1, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "f92f1f0-dirty", "question": "Which analyses unfold their measured distributions -- that is, correct them back to particle level or truth level?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "", "answered": false, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2103.04956", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2303.15340", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2506.13565"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "analyses that unfold measured distributions, correcting detector-level measurements back to particle level or truth level", "kind": "", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:method:unfolding-particle-parton | statistical_method | Unfolding of measurements to particle and parton levels\nhepkg:sample:ttbar_signal | sample | ttbar signal MC samp"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%unfold%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%particle level%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%truth level%' LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 51, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:systematic:pdf_scale_variation | systematic_uncertainty | PDF and mu_R, mu_F scale uncertainty (unfolding correction)\nhepkg:method:binned_maximum_likelihood_fit | statis"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, p.arxiv_id, p.title, a.predicate, e.kind, e.label FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id IN (a.subject_id, a.object_id) JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id WHERE lower(e.label) LIKE '%unfold%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%particle level%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%truth level%' LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 93, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | arxiv_id | title | predicate | kind | label\n2001.06899 | 2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton c"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT p.arxiv_id, p.title FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id WHERE a.predicate='result_uses_statistical_method' AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%unfold%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%t unfold%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%tikhonov%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%bayesian unfolding%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%svd unfolding%') ORDER BY p.arxiv_id"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$   TeV\n2110.11231 | Measu"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT p.arxiv_id, p.title FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id IN (a.subject_id,a.object_id) JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id WHERE (lower(e.label) LIKE '%particle level%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%truth level%') AND a.predicate IN ('result_measures_observable','result_reports_quantity','result_uses_statistical_method','result_defines_region','result_has_systematic') ORDER BY p.arxiv_id"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title\n2103.04956 | Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n2112."}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT p.arxiv_id, p.title, e.kind, e.label, a.predicate FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id WHERE lower(e.label) LIKE '%unfold%' ORDER BY p.arxiv_id LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title | kind | label | predicate\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=1"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT p.arxiv_id, p.title, a.predicate, e.kind, e.label FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id WHERE lower(e.label) LIKE '%unfold%' ORDER BY p.arxiv_id, a.predicate, e.label LIMIT 300"}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title | predicate | kind | label\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=1"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT p.arxiv_id, p.title FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id WHERE a.predicate='result_uses_statistical_method' AND lower(e.label) LIKE '%unfold%' ORDER BY p.arxiv_id"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$   TeV\n2110.11231 | Measu"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 6, "args": {"query": "SELECT p.arxiv_id, GROUP_CONCAT(DISTINCT e.label, ' | ') AS methods FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id WHERE a.predicate='result_uses_statistical_method' AND lower(e.label) LIKE '%unfold%' GROUP BY p.arxiv_id ORDER BY p.arxiv_id"}, "rows": 0, "error": "DISTINCT aggregates must have exactly one argument", "truncated": false, "preview": "ERROR: DISTINCT aggregates must have exactly one argument"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:final_state:emu_fiducial_particle_level", "hepkg:method:asimov-closure-test", "hepkg:method:binned_ma