{"run_id": "20260829T212149-free-sql-17601", "qid": "gabriel-gf-05", "repeat": 1, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "f92f1f0-dirty", "question": "Which analyses reconstruct a Higgs-boson candidate as a physical object they select on (rather than merely studying Higgs production or decay)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "Using the graph’s explicit **`object_has_selection`** links for reconstructed detector-level Higgs candidates, the analyses are:\n\n- **arXiv:2004.04545** — *CP Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the \\(t\\bar tH\\) and \\(tH\\) Processes Using \\(H\\to\\gamma\\gamma\\)*  \n  Selects a reconstructed **diphoton Higgs candidate** with an invariant-mass window.\n\n- **arXiv:2006.05880** — *Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or \\(Z\\) boson*  \n  Selects an \\(h\\to b\\bar b\\) **Higgs-boson candidate**, formed from a tagged jet pair and required to pass a neural-network threshold.\n\n- **arXiv:2103.04956** — *Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state*  \n  Selects a reconstructed **\\(ZZ\\to4\\ell\\) Higgs candidate**, including \\(m_{4\\ell}\\) and lepton-pair requirements.\n\n- **arXiv:2103.06956** — *Measurements of Higgs boson production cross sections and couplings in the diphoton decay channel*  \n  Selects a reconstructed **diphoton Higgs candidate** with photon-\\(p_T\\)-to-mass and invariant-mass requirements.\n\n- **arXiv:2207.00348** — *Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production in the \\(H\\to\\gamma\\gamma\\) channel*  \n  Selects a reconstructed **diphoton system** as the Higgs candidate.\n\n- **arXiv:2504.13081** — *Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections*  \n  Contains an explicitly reconstructed **Higgs-boson candidate**, with a reported selection of \\(p_T>60\\) GeV.\n\nI excluded analyses where “Higgs” appears only as the production process, decay mode, or a particle-level/theory object without an explicit reconstructed-candidate selection.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2006.05880", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2111.08340", "2207.00348", "2504.13081", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "Higgs boson candidate reconstructed candidate object selection", "kind": "", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:higgs_boson | detector_object | Higgs boson (reconstructed candidate)\nhepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate | detector_object | Higgs boson candidate\nhepkg:object:di"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT kind, COUNT(*) AS n FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%higgs%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h%' GROUP BY kind ORDER BY n DESC LIMIT 50"}, "rows": 21, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "kind | n\nevent_region | 405\nsample | 383\nsystematic_uncertainty | 360\nobservable | 243\nresult | 200\nstatistical_method | 181\ngenerator | 177\nchannel | 170\nbsm_model | 153\nphysics_process | 132\nbackgro"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.predicate, a.subject_id, s.label AS subject_label, a.object_id, e.label AS object_label, a.object_value FROM assertion a LEFT JOIN entity s ON s.entity_id=a.subject_id LEFT JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id WHERE (a.object_id IN ('hepkg:object:higgs_boson','hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate','hepkg:object:diphoton','hepkg:object:zz_candidate','hepkg:object:H-jet') OR lower(COALESCE(e.label,'')) LIKE '%higgs%candidate%' OR lower(COALESCE(e.label,'')) LIKE '%h boson candidate%') AND a.predicate IN ('object_has_selection','region_requires_object','result_defines_object','result_defines_region','channel_has_region') LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | predicate | subject_id | subject_label | object_id | object_label | object_value\n2006.05880 | region_requires_object | hepkg:object:SR-h-1A | Signal region SR^h_1A (1ℓ selection, small χ̃2⁰"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT eo.paper_id, eo.entity_id, eo.kind, eo.label FROM entity_occurrence eo WHERE eo.entity_id IN ('hepkg:object:higgs_boson','hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate','hepkg:object:diphoton','hepkg:object:zz_candidate','hepkg:object:H-jet') ORDER BY eo.paper_id, eo.kind"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | entity_id | kind | label\n2006.05880 | hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate | detector_object | Higgs boson candidate (h->bb jet pair, NN-tagged)\n2103.04956 | hepkg:object:zz_candidate | detec"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT p.arxiv_id,p.title,a.predicate,s.label AS subject_label,e.label AS object_label,a.object_value FROM assertion a JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id LEFT JOIN entity s ON s.entity_id=a.subject_id LEFT JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id WHERE a.paper_id IN ('2006.05880','2103.04956','2111.08340','2504.13081','2605.14245') AND (a.subject_id IN ('hepkg:object:higgs_boson','hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate','hepkg:object:diphoton','hepkg:object:zz_candidate','hepkg:object:H-jet') OR a.object_id IN ('hepkg:object:higgs_boson','hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate','hepkg:object:diphoton','hepkg:object:zz_candidate','hepkg:object:H-jet')) ORDER BY p.arxiv_id,a.predicate LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 23, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title | predicate | subject_label | object_label | object_value\n2006.05880 | Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or $Z$ boson using 139 fb -1 of $pp$ collision data at $\\sqrt{s}=1"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT p.arxiv_id,p.title FROM paper p JOIN assertion a ON a.paper_id=p.arxiv_id WHERE p.arxiv_id IN ('2006.05880','2103.04956','2111.08340','2504.13081','2605.14245') AND a.predicate IN ('object_has_selection','region_requires_object','channel_has_region','result_defines_region') ORDER BY p.arxiv_id"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title\n2006.05880 | Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or $Z$ boson using 139 fb -1 of $pp$ collision data at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n2103.04956 | Measurements o"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT p.arxiv_id,p.title, e.entity_id,e.kind,e.label,a.predicate,a.object_value FROM assertion a JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.subject_id WHERE a.predicate='object_has_selection' AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%higgs%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%h boson%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%diphoton%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%zz candidate%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%h-jet%') ORDER BY p.arxiv_id,e.label LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 18, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title | entity_id | kind | label | predicate | object_value\n2004.04545 | $CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarro"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT p.arxiv_id,p.title,e.entity_id,e.kind,e.label FROM assertion a JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.subject_id WHERE a.predicate='object_has_selection' AND e.kind='detector_object' AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%higgs%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%diphoton%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%h-jet%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%zz candidate%') ORDER BY p.arxiv_id"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title | entity_id | kind | label\n2004.04545 | $CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATL"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:H-jet", "hepkg:object:SR-h-1A", "hepkg:object:SR-h-1AB", "hepkg:object:SR-h-1B", "hepkg:object:diphoton", "hepkg:object:dipho