:btag-efficiency", "hepkg:systematic:btag-light", "hepkg:systematic:btag_efficiency", "hepkg:systematic:btag_efficiency_fastsim", "hepkg:systematic:btagging", "hepkg:systematic:btagging-experimental", "hepkg:systematic:btagging-sf", "hepkg:systematic:btagging_efficiency_uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:btagging_trackjet", "hepkg:systematic:double_b_tagger_efficiency_uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:jet_flavour_discriminant_shape", "hepkg:systematic:lepton-btag-reco", "hepkg:systematic:luminosity-pileup-jes-jer-btag", "hepkg:systematic:rw-btag-eff", "hepkg:systematic:signal-bjes", "hepkg:systematic:signal-btag-eff", "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-correction-merged"], "evidence_ids": [], "seen_values": [], "verification_score": null, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 6, "prompt_tokens": 43507, "completion_tokens": 1469, "rounds": 6, "seconds": 21.14962649345398, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 21.14962649345398, "llm_calls": 6.0, "tokens": 44976.0, "rounds": 6.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "judged_precision": 0.75, "judged_recall": 0.75, "judged_f1": 0.75, "judged_named_none": 0.0, "judged_coverage": 0.16666666666666666, "retrieval_reach": 1.0, "tool_calls": 6.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 215.0, "evidence_quotes": 0.0}}
{"run_id": "20260829T212149-free-sql-17601", "qid": "gabriel-gf-02", "repeat": 2, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "f92f1f0-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using an ABCD method, or an ABCD-style sideband or matrix method over independent regions?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The graph identifies **15 analyses** using an ABCD, ABCD-style, sideband, or matrix-method background estimate:\n\n### Direct ABCD or ABCD-style methods\n\n- **2004.01678** — *Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a \\(Z\\) Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV \\(pp\\) Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector*  \n  Method: `hepkg:method:modified-abcd-estimate` — modified ABCD estimate using four regions.\n\n- **2011.07812** — *Search for displaced leptons in \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV \\(pp\\) collisions with the ATLAS detector*  \n  Method: `hepkg:method:abcd-method` — ABCD estimate based on independent lepton-quality regions.\n\n- **2012.01581** — *Search for long-lived particles using displaced jets in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV*  \n  Method: `hepkg:method:data_driven_abcd_ratio` — ABCD-style ratio over eight non-overlapping regions, A–H.\n\n- **2404.06204** — *Precise measurements of \\(W\\)- and \\(Z\\)-boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using \\(pp\\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=5.02\\) TeV and \\(13\\) TeV*  \n  Method: `hepkg:background_method:z-multijet-abcd-sideband` — two-dimensional ABCD sideband method using regions B, C, and D.\n\n- **2511.11853** — *Search for a new neutral gauge boson produced in association with one or two \\(b\\) jets and decaying into a pair of muons in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV*  \n  Method: `hepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs` — ABCD/matrix estimate using data control regions and parametric fits.\n\n- **2604.27044** — *Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the \\(4b\\) final state*  \n  Method: `hepkg:method:abcd-reweighting` — multidimensional ABCD reweighting from control regions to the signal region.\n\n### Matrix or tight/loose-region methods\n\n- **2006.05880** — *Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or \\(Z\\) boson using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\(pp\\) collision data at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector*  \n  Method: `hepkg:method:data-driven-fnp` — tight/loose fake/non-prompt lepton matrix method.\n\n- **2106.01676** — *Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum*  \n  Method: `hepkg:method:matrix-method`.\n\n- **2202.08676** — *Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV*  \n  Method: `hepkg:method:matrix-method`.\n\n- **2209.07327** — *Search for pair production of vector-like quarks in leptonic final states*  \n  Method: `hepkg:method:matrix-method`.\n\n- **2307.01094** — *Search for pair production of squarks or gluinos decaying via sleptons or weak bosons in final states with two same-sign or three leptons*  \n  Method: `hepkg:method:matrix-method`.\n\n### Sideband-based data-driven estimates\n\n- **2103.06956** — *Measurements of Higgs boson production cross sections and couplings in the diphoton decay channel*  \n  Method: `hepkg:background_method:data_driven_nonprompt_control_sample` — photon-ID BDT sideband control sample for nonprompt photons.\n\n- **2206.09466** — *Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\(W\\) boson pair decay channel*  \n  Method: `hepkg:method:data-driven-sideband-extrapolation` — sideband/\\(Z\\)-peak extrapolation.\n\n- **2207.00348** — *Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production in the \\(H\\to\\gamma\\gamma\\) channel*  \n  Method: `hepkg:method:double-2d-sideband` — double two-dimensional sideband method.\n\n- **2401.05299** — *Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\(t\\bar t W\\) production*  \n  Method: `hepkg:method:qmisid-data-driven` — charge-misassignment rate determined with a \\(Z\\to e^+e^-\\) sideband method.\n\nThe first six are the clearest **ABCD/independent-region** cases; the next five are explicit **matrix-method** estimates; the final four are broader **sideband/control-region extrapolations** rather than textbook four-region ABCD estimates.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2006.05880", "2008.05928", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2307.01094", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "ABCD background estimation method independent regions", "kind": "", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:method:abcd-method | background_method | ABCD data-driven background estimation method\nhepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs | background_method | ABCD (matrix) d"}, {"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "sideband background estimate method", "kind": "", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:method:simulation_based_bkg_estimate | background_method | simulation-based background estimate\nhepkg:method:simulation_estimate | background_method | Direct simulation-"}, {"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "matrix method background estimate", "kind": "", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:method:simulation_based_bkg_estimate | background_method | simulation-based background estimate\nhepkg:method:matrix-method | background_method | Matrix method for miside"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, p.title, e.entity_id, e.kind, e.label, a.predicate\nFROM assertion a\nJOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nJOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id = a.paper_id\nWHERE a.predicate = 'background_uses_method'\n  AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%abcd%'\n       OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%matrix%'\n       OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%sideband%')\nORDER BY a.paper_id, e.label\nLIMIT 200"}, "rows": 18, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | entity_id | kind | label | predicate\n2004.01678 | Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from th"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, p.title, e.entity_id, e.label, a.notes, a.qualifiers, GROUP_CONCAT(DISTINCT substr(ev.quote,1,300), ' || ') AS evidence\nFROM assertion a\nJOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id\nJOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id\nLEFT JOIN assertion_evidence ae ON ae.assertion_id=a.assertion_id\nLEFT JOIN evidence ev ON ev.evidence_id=ae.evidence_id\nWHERE a.predicate='background_uses_method'\n  AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%abcd%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%matrix%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%sideband%')\nGROUP BY a.assertion_id\nORDER BY a.paper_id\nLIMIT 100"}, "rows": 0, "error": "DISTINCT aggregates must have exactly one argument", "truncated": false, "preview": "ERROR: DISTINCT aggregates must have exactly one argument"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, p.title, e.entity_id, e.label, GROUP_CONCAT(substr(ev.quote,1,500), ' || ') AS evidence\nFROM assertion a\nJOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id\nJOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id\nLEFT JOIN assertion_evidence ae ON ae.assertion_id=a.assertion_id\nLEFT JOIN evidence ev ON ev.evidence_id=ae.evidence_id\nWHERE a.predicate='background_uses_method'\n  AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%abcd%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%matrix%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%sideband%')\nGROUP BY a.assertion_id\nORDER BY a.paper_id\nLIMIT 100"}, "rows": 25, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | entity_id | label | evidence\n2004.01678 | Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from the ATLAS "}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, p.title, e.entity_id, e.label\nFROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id\nWHERE a.predicate='background_uses_method'\nAND e.entity_id IN ('hepkg:method:modified-abcd-estimate','hepkg:method:abcd-method','hepkg:method:data_driven_abcd_ratio','hepkg:background_method:z-multijet-abcd-sideband','hepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs','hepkg:method:abcd-reweighting','hepkg:method:matrix-method','hepkg:method:data-driven-fnp','hepkg:method:data-driven-sideband-extrapolation','hepkg:method:double-2d-sideband','hepkg:background_method:data_driven_nonprompt_control_sample','hepkg:method:qmisid-data-driven')\nORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | entity_id | label\n2004.01678 | Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector | "}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:dyjets", "hepkg:background:sr-total", "hepkg:background:ttbar", "hepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs", "hepkg:background_method:data_driven_nonprompt_control_sample", "hepkg:background_method:discrete_profiling", "hepkg:background_method:z-multijet-abcd-sideband", "hepkg:method:abcd-method", "hepkg:method:abcd-reweighting", "hepkg:method:bootstrapping_pseudo_experiments", "hepkg:method:cr-data-driven-normalization", "hepkg:method:cr-mistag-rate-estimation", "hepkg:method:data-driven-background-fit", "hepkg:method:data-driven-fnp", "hepkg:method:data-driven-sideband-extrapolation", "hepkg:method:data-mixing-background-estimation", "hepkg:method:data_driven_abcd_ratio", "hepkg:method:data_driven_emu_cr", "hepkg:method:data_sideband_fit", "hepkg:method:dedicated_control_regions", "hepkg:method:discrete-profiling-method", "hepkg:method:discrete_profiling", "hepkg:method:double-2d-sideband", "hepkg:method:matrix-method", "hepkg:method:matrix_method", "hepkg:method:mc-direct-estimate", "hepkg:method:mc-simulation-default", "hepkg:method:mc_simulation_estimation", "hepkg:method:mc_template", "hepkg:method:modified-abcd-estimate", "hepkg:method:parametric-fit-tth", "hepkg:method:qmisid-data-driven", "hepkg:method:simulation-based-background-vbf", "hepkg:method:simulation_based_bkg_estimate", "hepkg:method:simulation_estimate", "hepkg:object:VR-Z-ttZ", "hepkg:region:VR_sideband", "hepkg:region:abcd-region-a", "hepkg:region:abcd-region-b", "hepkg:region:abcd-region-c", "hepkg:region:cr-sideband", "hepkg:region:vr-top", "hepkg:syst:background_fit", "hepkg:systematic:background-estimation-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:background-extrapolation-bias", "hepkg:systematic:data_driven_bkg_method_uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:fnp-lepton-datadriven", "hepkg:systematic:multijet-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:multijet_modelling", "hepkg:systematic:reducible_background_estimation", "hepkg:systematic:symmetric_background_estimate"], "evidence_ids": [], "seen_values": [], "verification_score": null, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 6, "prompt_tokens": 33871, "completion_tokens": 3057, "rounds": 6, "seconds": 35.439398765563965, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 35.439398765563965, "llm_calls": 6.0, "tokens": 36928.0, "rounds": 6.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "judged_precision": 0.8888888888888888, "judged_recall": 0.8888888888888888, "judged_f1": 0.8888888888888888, "judged_named_none": 0.0, "judged_coverage": 0.23333333333333334, "retrieval_reach": 1.0, "tool_calls": 7.0, "tool_errors": 1.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.14285714285714285, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 51.0, "evidence_quotes": 0.0}}
{"run_id": "20260829T212149-free-sql-17601", "qid": "gabriel-gf-03", "repeat": 2, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "f92f1f0-dirty", "question": "Which analyses use the HistFitter framework for their statistical analysis?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analyses using the **HistFitter** framework are:\n\n- **arXiv:2006.05880** — *Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or \\(Z\\) boson using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\(pp\\) collision data at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector*\n- **arXiv:2011.07812** — *Search for displaced leptons in \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV \\(pp\\) collisions with the ATLAS detector*\n- **arXiv:2211.08028** — *Search for supersymmetry in final states with missing transverse momentum and three or more \\(b\\)-jets in 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of proton–proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector*", "answered": true, "papers": ["2006.05880", "2011.07812", "2211.08028"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "HistFitter framework statistical analysis", "kind": "", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:method:histfitter | statistical_method | HistFitter statistical framework\nhepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit-histfitter | statistical_method | HistFitter fit\nhepkg:meth"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT p.arxiv_id, p.title, a.predicate, a.object_id, e.label AS method_label\nFROM assertion a\nJOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id = a.paper_id\nJOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.object_id IN ('hepkg:method:histfitter','hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit-histfitter','hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit')\n  AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%histfitter%')\nORDER BY p.arxiv_id, a.predicate\nLIMIT 200"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title | predicate | object_id | method_label\n2006.05880 | Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or $Z$ boson using 139 fb -1 of $pp$ collision data at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATL"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:method:bayesian-eftfitter-batjl", "hepkg:method:bootstrap_compatibility", "hepkg:method:bootstrap_correlation_test", "hepkg:method:cms_combine_tool", "hepkg:method:histfitter", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit-histfitter", "hepkg:method:pyhf-combination", "hepkg:method:simplified-likelihood-reinterpretation", "hepkg:model:coupling_modifier_framework", "hepkg:model:kappa-framework-hh", "hepkg:model:kappa_framework", "hepkg:region:AR", "hepkg:region:hmumu_categories", "hepkg:region:hzgamma_categories", "hepkg:sample:vbf_hbb_ggf_vbf_sample", "hepkg:statistical_method:combine_roofit_roostats_tool", "hepkg:statmethod:combine_roofit_roostats", "hepkg:statmethod:pca-fisher-info", "hepkg:systematic:statistical-mc"], "evidence_ids": [], "seen_values": [], "verification_score": null, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 3, "prompt_tokens": 8266, "completion_tokens": 416, "rounds": 3, "seconds": 8.316848993301392, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 8.316848993301392, "llm_calls": 3.0, "tokens": 8682.0, "rounds": 3.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "judged_precision": 1.0, "judged_recall": 0.6, "judged_f1": 0.7499999999999999, "judged_named_none": 0.0, "judged_coverage": 0.15, "retrieval_reach": 0.6, "tool_calls": 2.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 20.0, "evidence_quotes": 0.0}}
{"run_id": "20260829T212149-free-sql-17601", "qid": "gabriel-gf-04", "repeat": 2, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "f92f1f0-dirty", "question": "Which analyses unfold their measured distributions -- that is, correct them back to particle level or truth level?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "", "answered": false, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2012.08600", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "unfolded distribution particle level truth level detector correction", "kind": "", "limit": 30}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:muon_veto_detector | detector_object | Veto muon, detector level\nhepkg:object:electron_veto_detector | detector_object | Veto electron, detector level\nhepkg:resul"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT predicate, family, object_value, notes FROM assertion WHERE lower(coalesce(object_value,'')) LIKE '%unfold%' OR lower(coalesce(notes,'')) LIKE '%unfold%' LIMIT 100"}, "rows": 71, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "predicate | family | object_value | notes\nchannel_has_region | channels_regions |  | Consistent with unfolding to particle level within dilepton channel.\nresult_defines_object | objects |  | Used for "}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT p.arxiv_id, p.title, COUNT(DISTINCT a.assertion_id) AS n, group_concat(DISTINCT a.predicate) AS predicates FROM assertion a JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id WHERE lower(COALESCE(a.notes,'')||' '||COALESCE(a.object_value,'')||' '||COALESCE(a.qualifiers,'')) LIKE '%unfold%' GROUP BY p.arxiv_id,p.title ORDER BY p.arxiv_id LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 39, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title | n | predicates\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$   TeV |"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT p.arxiv_id,p.title,a.object_value,a.notes FROM assertion a JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id WHERE a.predicate='result_measures_observable' AND (lower(COALESCE(a.notes,'')||' '||COALESCE(a.object_value,'')) LIKE '%unfold%' OR lower(COALESCE(a.notes,'')||' '||COALESCE(a.object_value,'')) LIKE '%particle level%' OR lower(COALESCE(a.notes,'')||' '||COALESCE(a.object_value,'')) LIKE '%truth level%') ORDER BY p.arxiv_id LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title | object_value | notes\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$  "}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT p.arxiv_id,p.title FROM assertion a JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id WHERE lower(COALESCE(a.notes,'')||' '||COALESCE(a.object_value,'')||' '||COALESCE(a.qualifiers,'')) LIKE '%unfold%' AND lower(COALESCE(a.notes,'')||' '||COALESCE(a.object_value,'')||' '||COALESCE(a.qualifiers,'')) NOT LIKE '%not an unfolded%' AND lower(COALESCE(a.notes,'')||' '||COALESCE(a.object_value,'')||' '||COALESCE(a.qualifiers,'')) NOT LIKE '%no unfolding%' ORDER BY p.arxiv_id"}, "rows": 36, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$   TeV\n2004.01678 | Searc"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT p.arxiv_id,p.title, COUNT(*) n, group_concat(DISTINCT CASE WHEN a.predicate='result_uses_statistical_method' THEN e.label END) methods, group_concat(DISTINCT CASE WHEN a.predicate='result_measures_observable' THEN COALESCE(e.label,a.object_value) END) observables FROM assertion a JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id LEFT JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id WHERE lower(COALESCE(a.notes,'')||' '||COALESCE(a.object_value,'')||' '||COALESCE(a.qualifiers,'')) LIKE '%unfold%' AND lower(COALESCE(a.notes,'')||' '||COALESCE(a.object_value,'')||' '||COALESCE(a.qualifiers,'')) NOT LIKE '%not an unfolded%' AND lower(COALESCE(a.notes,'')||' '||COALESCE(a.object_value,'')||' '||COALESCE(a.qualifiers,'')) NOT LIKE '%no unfolding%' GROUP BY p.arxiv_id,p.title ORDER BY p.arxiv_id"}, "rows": 36, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title | n | methods | observables\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}="}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 6, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT p.arxiv_id,p.title,e.label AS method FROM assertion a JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id WHERE a.predicate='result_uses_statistical_method' AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%unfold%' OR lower(COALESCE(a.notes,'')) LIKE '%unfold%') ORDER BY p.arxiv_id"}, "rows": 22, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title | method\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$   TeV | Binned "}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:method:chi2-compatibility-test", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-unfolding", "hepkg:method:ttbar-ht-cr-correction", "hepkg:method:unfolding-particle-parton", "hepkg:object:electron_veto_detector", "hepkg:object:muon_signal_detector", "hepkg:object:muon_veto_detector", "hepkg:object:muon_veto_particle", "hepkg:object:particle_level_jet", "hepkg:object:pseudo-top-particle-4l", "hepkg:object:ttbar_system_particle", "hepkg:region:detector_sr_dilepton", "hepkg:region:fiducial-particle", "hepkg:region:fiducial-region", "hepkg:region:w-enu-detector-sr", "hepkg:region:w-munu-detector-sr", "hepkg:region:w_minus_signal_region", "hepkg:region:z-ee-detector-sr", "hepkg:region:z-mumu-detector-sr", "hepkg:region:z_signal_region", "hepkg:result:wminus-pt-13tev", "hepkg:result:wminus-pt-5p02tev", "hepkg:result:wplus-pt-13tev", "hepkg:result:wplus-pt-5p02tev", "hepkg:result:wz-differential-xsec", "hepkg:result:z-pt-ut-13tev", "hepkg:result:z-pt-ut-5p02tev", "hepkg:sample:ttbar_signal", "hepkg:systematic:background-related-uncertainty-differential", "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-ht-correction"], "evidence_ids": [], "seen_values": [], "verification_score": null, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 6, "prompt_tokens": 43931, "completion_tokens": 1179, "rounds": 6, "seconds": 18.146150588989258, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 18.146150588989258, "llm_calls": 6.0, "tokens": 45110.0, "rounds": 6.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 0.0, "abstained": 1.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "judged_precision": 0.0, "judged_recall": 0.0, "judged_f1": 0.0, "judged_named_none": 1.0, "judged_coverage": 0.2833333333333333, "retrieval_reach": 1.0, "tool_calls": 7.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 30.0, "evidence_quotes": 0.0}}
{"run_id": "20260829T212149-free-sql-17601", "qid": "gabriel-gf-05", "repeat": 2, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "f92f1f0-dirty", "question": "Which analyses reconstruct a Higgs-boson candidate as a physical object they select on (rather than merely studying Higgs production or decay)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "", "answered": false, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2006.05880", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2302.05225", "2407.10549", "2504.13081", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "Higgs boson candidate reconstructed as a selected physical object, Higgs candidate object selection", "kind": "", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:higgs_boson | detector_object | Higgs boson (reconstructed candidate)\nhepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate | detector_object | Higgs boson candidate\nhepkg:object:di"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, p.title, a.predicate, a.subject_id, es.label AS subject_label, a.object_id, eo.label AS object_label, a.object_value FROM assertion a JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id LEFT JOIN entity es ON es.entity_id=a.subject_id LEFT JOIN entity eo ON eo.entity_id=a.object_id WHERE a.predicate IN ('object_has_selection','region_requires_object','result_defines_object','channel_has_region','result_defines_region') AND (lower(COALESCE(eo.label,'')) LIKE '%higgs%' OR lower(COALESCE(eo.label,'')) LIKE '%h boson%' OR lower(COALESCE(eo.label,'')) LIKE '%h→%' OR lower(COALESCE(eo.label,'')) LIKE '%higgs%' OR lower(COALESCE(es.label,'')) LIKE '%higgs%' OR lower(COALESCE(es.label,'')) LIKE '%h boson%') LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 200, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | predicate | subject_id | subject_label | object_id | object_label | object_value\n2006.05880 | Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or $Z$ boson using 139 fb -1 of $pp$ coll"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT e.entity_id, e.kind, e.label, COUNT(DISTINCT eo.paper_id) AS papers FROM entity e JOIN entity_occurrence eo ON eo.entity_id=e.entity_id WHERE lower(e.label) LIKE '%higgs%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%h boson%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%h-boson%' GROUP BY e.entity_id,e.kind,e.label ORDER BY papers DESC LIMIT 100"}, "rows": 100, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label | papers\nhepkg:process:tth | physics_process | Higgs boson production in association with a top quark pair (ttH) | 5\nhepkg:sample:diboson | sample | Diboson (VV) background sa"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, p.title, a.predicate, a.subject_id, es.label AS subject_label, a.object_id, eo.label AS object_label, a.object_value FROM assertion a JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id LEFT JOIN entity es ON es.entity_id=a.subject_id LEFT JOIN entity eo ON eo.entity_id=a.object_id WHERE (a.subject_id IN ('hepkg:object:higgs_boson','hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate','hepkg:object:diphoton','hepkg:object:zz_candidate','hepkg:object:higgs-boson-particle-level','hepkg:object:H-jet') OR a.object_id IN ('hepkg:object:higgs_boson','hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate','hepkg:object:diphoton','hepkg:object:zz_candidate','hepkg:object:higgs-boson-particle-level','hepkg:object:H-jet')) AND a.predicate IN ('object_has_selection','region_requires_object','result_defines_object','channel_has_region','result_defines_region') ORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 25, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | predicate | subject_id | subject_label | object_id | object_label | object_value\n2006.05880 | Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or $Z$ boson using 139 fb -1 of $pp$ coll"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT eo.paper_id, p.title, eo.entity_id, eo.kind, eo.label FROM entity_occurrence eo JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=eo.paper_id WHERE eo.entity_id IN ('hepkg:object:higgs_boson','hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate','hepkg:object:diphoton','hepkg:object:zz_candidate','hepkg:object:higgs-boson-particle-level','hepkg:object:H-jet') ORDER BY eo.paper_id, eo.entity_id"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | entity_id | kind | label\n2006.05880 | Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or $Z$ boson using 139 fb -1 of $pp$ collision data at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector "}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, p.title, a.predicate, a.subject_id, es.kind AS subject_kind, es.label AS subject_label, a.object_id, eo.kind AS object_kind, eo.label AS object_label, a.object_value FROM assertion a JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id LEFT JOIN entity es ON es.entity_id=a.subject_id LEFT JOIN entity eo ON eo.entity_id=a.object_id WHERE a.predicate IN ('object_has_selection','region_requires_object','result_defines_object','result_defines_region','channel_has_region') AND (lower(COALESCE(es.label,'')) LIKE '%higgs%' OR lower(COALESCE(es.label,'')) LIKE '%h-jet%' OR lower(COALESCE(es.label,'')) LIKE '%diphoton%' OR lower(COALESCE(es.label,'')) LIKE '%zz candidate%' OR lower(COALESCE(eo.label,'')) LIKE '%higgs%' OR lower(COALESCE(eo.label,'')) LIKE '%h-jet%' OR lower(COALESCE(eo.label,'')) LIKE '%diphoton%' OR lower(COALESCE(eo.label,'')) LIKE '%zz candidate%') ORDER BY a.paper_id, a.predicate LIMIT 300"}, "rows": 200, "error": null, "truncated": true, "preview": "paper_id | title | predicate | subject_id | subject_kind | subject_label | object_id | object_kind | object_label | object_value\n2004.01678 | Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, p.title, a.subject_id, es.kind, es.label, a.object_value FROM assertion a JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id JOIN entity es ON es.entity_id=a.subject_id WHERE a.predicate='object_has_selection' AND (lower(es.label) LIKE '%higgs%' OR lower(es.label) LIKE '%diphoton%' OR lower(es.label) LIKE '%h-jet%' OR lower(es.label) LIKE '%zz candidate%' OR lower(es.label) LIKE '%h candidate%') ORDER BY a.paper_id LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 18, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | subject_id | kind | label | object_value\n2004.04545 | $CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gam"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 6, "args": {"query": "SELECT e.entity_id,e.kind,e.label,COUNT(DISTINCT a.paper_id) AS assertion_papers,GROUP_CONCAT(DISTINCT a.predicate) AS predicates FROM entity e LEFT JOIN assertion a ON a.subject_id=e.entity_id OR a.object_id=e.entity_id WHERE lower(e.label) LIKE '%candidate%' AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%higgs%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%diphoton%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%h-jet%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%zz%') GROUP BY e.entity_id,e.kind,e.label ORDER BY assertion_papers DESC"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label | assertion_papers | predicates\nhepkg:object:diphoton_system | detector_object | Diphoton system (H→γγ candidate) | 2 | object_has_selection,result_defines_object\nhepkg:final_"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:bbgamgam_singleH", "hepkg:background:ggf_contamination", "hepkg:background:ggf_production", "hepkg:background:other-higgs", "hepkg:background:other-sm-minor", "hepkg:background:other_higgs", "hepkg:background:rare", "hepkg:background:rare-sm", "hepkg:background:single_higgs_bkg_dihiggs", "hepkg:background:singleh", "hepkg:background:sm_higgs_decays", "hepkg:background:vbf_production", "hepkg:background:vh", "hepkg:background:wwgamgam_singleH"